1
00:00:00,698 --> 00:00:02,608
(Leonard:)It only gets funnier
when you explain it, Sheldon.

2
00:00:03,935 --> 00:00:05,435
(Sheldon:)I know.

3
00:00:10,041 --> 00:00:12,711
(Howard:)Okay, she's all settled in the guest room.

4
00:00:12,877 --> 00:00:15,547
(Bernadette:)Maybe we should get one of those
machines to help her up the stairs.

5
00:00:15,713 --> 00:00:17,283
(Howard:)You mean a forklift?

6
00:00:19,317 --> 00:00:20,527
(Bernadette:)-Howie...
-I'm sorry.

7
00:00:20,685 --> 00:00:22,465
(Howard:)I just can't deal
with this right now.

8
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,790
(Bernadette:)Taking care of your own mother?
How can you say that?

9
00:00:24,956 --> 00:00:27,566
(Howard:)Bernie, she's gonna be off her feet
for six to eight weeks.

10
00:00:27,725 --> 00:00:31,405
(Howard:)Are you prepared to feed her,
wash her and take her to the toilet?

11
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:35,070
(Bernadette:)-I would do it for my mother.
-Yeah, of course you would.

12
00:00:35,233 --> 00:00:36,903
(Howard:)You're a loving person.

13
00:00:37,068 --> 00:00:39,908
(Howard:)I'm what my people would call a putz.

14
00:00:42,306 --> 00:00:45,516
(Bernadette:)Look, I'm not crazy about the idea,
but what other choice do we have?

15
00:00:45,677 --> 00:00:48,817
(Howard:)We get a nurse. Preferably someone
from a third world country

16
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:51,930
(Howard:)who's used to suffering
and unpleasant smells.

17
00:00:54,552 --> 00:00:56,262
(Bernadette:)You'd hire a total stranger
to take care

18
00:00:56,421 --> 00:00:58,371
(Bernadette:)of the woman who raised you?
That's so cruel.

19
00:00:58,523 --> 00:01:00,663
(Howard:)Not if we pay them well

